            <div class="page-section">
               <section>
                  
                  <h2>Welcome to the Home of the Warriors!</h2>
                  
                  <p>Discover the excitement of athletic excellence at Massasoit Community College’s premier
                     NJCAA Division III, Region 21 varsity athletic program. Our dedicated student athletes
                     have garnered an impressive 96 NJCAA All-American awards and an astounding 851 Region
                     21 awards.</p>
                  
                  <p><a href="https://massasoitccwarriors.com/landing/index" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more about our Varsity Sports program and game schedule</a>.</p>
                  Our diverse teams showcase the best in sportsmanship and talent, including men’s and
                  women’s basketball, soccer, and track and field. Additionally, we take immense pride
                  in our men’s baseball and women’s volleyball teams, who continue to make us proud
                  with their remarkable achievements.</section>
               
               <section>
                  
                  <div class="py-4">
                     <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                           <div class="showcase-grid">
                              
                              <td data-name="content" data-type="wysiwyg">
                                 
                                 <h3><span style="font-size: 24px;">Men’s Teams</span></h3>
                                 
                                 <ul>
                                    
                                    <li>Baseball</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Basketball</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Soccer</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Track &amp; Field</li>
                                    </ul>
                                 </td>
                              </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch mt-md-0 mt-3">
                           <div class="showcase-grid">
                              
                              <td data-name="content" data-type="wysiwyg">
                                 
                                 <h3><span style="font-size: 24px;">Women’s Teams</span></h3>
                                 
                                 <ul>
                                    
                                    <li>Basketball</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Soccer</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Volleyball</li>
                                    
                                    <li>Track &amp; Field</li>
                                    </ul>
                                 </td>
                              </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  </section>
               
               <section>
                  
                  <h3>Athletic Facilities</h3>
                  
                  <p>The heart of our athletic prowess lies in the Peter Asiaf Field House. This exceptional
                     facility boasts an Olympic-sized swimming pool, a newly renovated <span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Fitness Center with weight and cardio equipment</span>, and a basketball and volleyball court. Step outside and witness the action unfold
                     on our top-notch outdoor soccer and baseball fields.</p>
                  
                  <p>At Massasoit, we believe in fostering a sense of community and inclusivity. That’s
                     why we offer open court times, thrilling games that ignite the spirit of competition,
                     and exciting spirit nights that unite fans in a sea of pride and enthusiasm. For those
                     looking for a more casual experience, our intramural programs provide the perfect
                     opportunity to stay active and connect with fellow students.</p>
                  
                  <p>Join us as we celebrate the dedication, perseverance, and triumphs of our extraordinary
                     Warriors. Whether you’re a student, an alum, or a passionate supporter, there’s a
                     place for you in the heart of our athletic family.</p>
                  
                  <p>Gear up, get involved, and let the warrior spirit guide you to new heights at Massasoit
                     Community College!</p>
                  </section>
            </div>
         </div>
         
         
         
